    <expires>2026-02-15T10:00:00+01:00</expires>
    <senderName>LU</senderName>
    <headline>Floods on the Moselle</headline>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Moselle has been placed under awareness level yellow floods from 13.02.2026 10:00 to 15.02.2026 10:00. The awareness level can be adapted or extended depending on the evolution of the situation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Water levels on the Moselle continue to rise and will exceed the ‘Cote de vigilance jaune’ of 530 cm at the Stadtbredimus gauge (Remich: 452 cm) on Friday evening. Highest levels will situate around the level of 550 cm – 560 cm at the Stadtbredimus gauge on Saturday evening. On Sunday water levels will fall again and pass under the level of the ‘Cote de vigilance jaune’ during the day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Update if the situation changes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please take precautions and inform yourself on the right behaviour to adopt.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For further information, measured and forecasted water levels, please visit the &amp;#39;inondations.lu&amp;#39; website and follow attentively the information provided in the eventually published flood reports.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <parameter>
